{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Keep terminal waiters blocked through operation-change hooks.** This runs after terminal operation futures are completed. A resumed handler can enter a follow-up at-least-once step while the hook is blocked; if the hook then fails fatally, replay can repeat that step's side effect. Publish storage, dispatch `onOperationChange`, and only then release terminal waiters. Add a blocked-hook/follow-up-step regression.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75xmMT","finding_digest":"2ec144e6d7922e9aa3a8e7041782be2f4faa8c07697c1c489710a29503fe727c","finding_id":"arf_v1_f3aujzwxsixjvi5i44cbpav6f5","finding_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::oncheckpointcomplete::operation-change-fatal-after-waiter-release","identity_key":"sdk/execution/executionmanager::oncheckpointcomplete::operation-change-fatal-after-waiter-release","line":278,"observation_digest":"476b3a054e0ad0226b41edff1ace99fff5531dc957940964a12759faf46d7afa","observation_id":"aro_v1_i5vtubkoblice22b5x7rvtuz77","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManager.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_f3aujzwxsixjvi5i44cbpav6f5","published_at":"2026-10-06T01:07:54Z","review_id":"arr_v1_buxa4o7ugg7rmklkn6vcnqh7ie","reviewed_base_sha":"ac6a6f5ea50d6a9098b716905f01c609e4c201ae","reviewed_head_sha":"1ebdc9ba92eafd4373735e9cf369acf681fac4ab","reviewer":"codex","start_line":278,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_n5ijrcxtubclqfffgcppf7qsg3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T01:07:54Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
